# Copy into .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the team names with yours.
# The last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all goes first.
# Approvers per priority follow the risk-acceptance policy in The AppSec Program Playbook, 3.1.
/exceptions/                               @your-org/security-leadership
/exceptions/p1/                            @your-org/exec-approvers @your-org/ciso-office
/exceptions/p2/                            @your-org/vp-eng @your-org/security-leadership
/exceptions/p3/                            @your-org/eng-directors @your-org/appsec-leads
/exceptions/p4/                            @your-org/eng-managers @your-org/appsec
/exceptions/hygiene/                       @your-org/eng-managers @your-org/appsec
# Security owns the rules, so nobody can weaken the check in the same PR that relies on it.
/.github/CODEOWNERS                        @your-org/security-leadership
/.github/workflows/exception-expiry.yml    @your-org/security-leadership
/scripts/check-exceptions.sh               @your-org/security-leadership
